        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When a job condition requires that one or several Employees on a day tour be scheduled to report one hour or more before the majority of Employees on that tour on one or several days in the week, such Employees shall be paid an expense allowance of $3.00 for each day on which Employee so reports, except that on a day tour with four (4) Employees or less, such an allowance will be paid to all Employees so scheduled. Such allowance shall not be paid (a) where the earlier starting time is for the convenience or at the request of the Employee, (b) when the Employee is scheduled in advance to report at the earlier hour for all days (Monday to Friday) in the week, or (c) when the earlier starting time is due to a Call-In.",
